cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Network Scope in research or a published assessment, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Network Scope"
abstract: >-
  Portable network discovery and inventory for IT and OT networks: TCP/SYN/UDP scanning,
  service, TLS and SMB detection, risk findings with version-based CVE hints, a SQLite inventory
  with diffs, monitoring, and read-only identification and passive analysis of industrial
  protocols (Modbus/TCP, S7, EtherNet/IP, BACnet/IP, OPC UA).
authors:
  - alias: Sparkz400
version: 0.5.1
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Sparkz400/network-scope"
url: "https://sparkz400.github.io/network-scope/"
keywords:
  - network scanner
  - asset inventory
  - industrial control systems
  - OT security
  - Rust
